/Subject (The NC7SZ04 is a single inverter from ON Semiconductor's Ultra-High Speed \(UHS\) series of TinyLogic. The device is fabricated with advanced CMOS technology to achieve ultra-high speed with high output drive while maintaining low static power dissipation over a broad VCC operating range. The device is specified to operate over the 1.65 V to 5.5 V VCC operating range. The inputs and output are high-impedance when VCC is 0 V. Inputs tolerate voltages up to 5.5 V, independent of VCC operating voltage.)
/Title (NC7SZ04 - TinyLogic UHS Inverter)
>>
